# Local secrets overlay (gitignored). Copy to setup.local.conf and fill in.
# Read by scripts/setup-config.{sh,ps1} in addition to setup.conf; absent or
# empty -> no OTLP auth header is rendered (fine for the local demo APM Server,
# whose security is disabled).
#
# telemetry.otlp_api_key: an APM/OTLP API key. When set, the agent sends
# `Authorization: ApiKey <key>` on its OTLP exports (see SPEC/config-deployment.md).
telemetry.otlp_api_key=
